<title>USA: PC411 Inc units rise sharply at debut.</title>
<headline>PC411 Inc units rise sharply at debut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Units in PC411 Inc rose sharply on Friday to close at 9-1/2, up from their original price of $5.75.</p>
<p>A total of 1.15 million units in the planned initial public offering in PC411 Inc priced at $5.75 on Wednesday but were traded on Friday.  The estimated price range for the units, which consisted of one common share and one warrant, was between $5 and $6.</p>
</text>
